// rts/data/ai/aggressive.json: the aggressive skirmish AI profile. Part of rts/data/ai; DataLoader keeps the parsed file in DataSet.AiProfiles and Rts.Ai.AiProfile.Parse validates it (spec: rts/docs/specs/skirmish_ai.md). Attacks early with a small army and keeps reinforcing; retreats late.
{
  "$schema_version": 1,
