      // Army mix as integer weights per unit ID. Unit: weight. Range: 0 to 100 each, at least one above 0. Source: Factions / Water faction / Unit concepts; placeholder (common-cost units only).
      "composition": { "water.grasper": 3, "water.shellback": 1 },
      // Attack only while the tide level is at or above this. Unit: fraction (0 low tide, 1 high tide). Range: 0 to 1. Source: Matchups (the water player times attacks for high tide); placeholder.
